# The Potential Within (outlands 146): a level 75 Samurai, great katana skill 250 (2500), a Tachi of Trials with 300
# weapon skill points held (a GM); the SAM chain completed (GMs: Forge Your Destiny's 25 and the AF offers would outrank
# 178), so Jaucribaix's other reply is A Thief in Norg!?'s 165 (replaceDefault). Available: Jaucribaix 178 (Event, once
# per zone) beats 165, option 0: nothing; again: 178 performed this zone: ignored: 165; out of Norg and back (the local
# vars cleared): 178, option 1 (the tachi held): the Weapon Training Guide, begun. Accepted: 179 (1: the tachi held),
# option 1: the tachi held: nothing; the tachi traded (300 points): 181 (the tachi taken by confirmTrade; the Map to the
# Annals of Truth); 182 (the map). Kuftal Tunnel's qm3: the map, no annals: Kettenkaefer popped (claimed),
# SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE; Kettenkaefer killed: killed_wsnm 1; qm3: the local var cleared, the Annals of Truth (a keyItem
# reply); qm3 again: nil: its default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. Norg: Jaucribaix 183: completed (fame), the three key
# items taken, Tachi: Kasha learnt, TACHI_KASHA_LEARNED; again: no section: 165.
lists Norg/Jaucribaix/onTrigger Norg/Jaucribaix/onTrade KuftalTunnel/qm3/onTrigger Norg/onEventFinish/183
char zone=Norg pos=91,-7,-8 job=SAM lvl=75
skill GreatKatana 2500
item TachiOfTrials wsp=300
quest Outlands.ForgeYourDestiny completed
quest Outlands.TheSacredKatana completed
quest Outlands.YomiOkuri completed
quest Outlands.AThiefInNorg completed
login
trigger Jaucribaix                      # available: 178 (Event, once per zone) beats 165 (replaceDefault)
finish option=0                         # nothing
trigger Jaucribaix                      # 178 performed this zone: ignored: 165
finish
warp -63,7,0 PortJeuno                  # out of Norg and back: the local vars cleared
warp 91,-7,-8 Norg
trigger Jaucribaix                      # 178
finish option=1                         # the tachi held: the Weapon Training Guide; begun
trigger Jaucribaix                      # accepted: 179 (1)
finish option=1                         # the tachi held: nothing
trade Jaucribaix TachiOfTrials x1       # 300 points: 181
finish                                  # the tachi taken; the Map to the Annals of Truth
trigger Jaucribaix                      # the map: 182
finish
warp 200,11,99 KuftalTunnel
trigger qm3                             # the map, no annals: Kettenkaefer popped; SENSE_OMINOUS_PRESENCE
kill KETTENKAEFER                       # the map held: killed_wsnm 1
trigger qm3                             # killed_wsnm 1: cleared; the Annals of Truth
trigger qm3                             # the annals held: nil: default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 91,-7,-8 Norg
trigger Jaucribaix                      # the annals: 183
finish                                  # completed; the key items taken; Tachi: Kasha; TACHI_KASHA_LEARNED
trigger Jaucribaix                      # completed: no section: 165
finish
